{"c":[],"e":[[1,1,"<b>Rehoboam</b> </p> <p> called Roboam. <a data-ref=\"Matt.1.7\">Matthew 1:7</a>."],[16,16,"<b>saying</b></p> <p><i>(See Scofield \"Judges 8:1\")</i>."],[32,32,"<b>eighth month</b> i.e. November. <a data-ref=\"1Kgs.12.33\">1 Kings 12:33</a>.</p> <p><b>altar</b> See <a data-ref=\"1Kgs.12.25-1Kgs.12.33\">1 Kings 12:25-33</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deut.12.4-Deut.12.14\">Deuteronomy 12:4-14</a>. <i>(See Scofield \"<a data-ref=\"Amos.4.4\">Amos 4:4</a>\")</i>."]]}